          "Derby High School offers a variety of language courses, including Spanish, French, and German, to help students meet language proficiency requirements and broaden their cultural understanding.",
          "Derby High School has a comprehensive career and technical education (CTE) program that offers courses in areas such as business, health sciences, information technology, and culinary arts.",
          "The school organizes various events throughout the year, such as pep rallies, talent shows, dances, and community service initiatives.",
          "The school offers advanced placement (AP) classes for students looking to challenge themselves academically and earn college credit.",
          "School hours at Derby High School include regular periods for classes, as well as extracurricular activities and events.",
          "Students can join Derby High School by following the enrollment procedures outlined by the school district. Additionally, there are various classes available for students to attend, covering a range of subjects.",
          "Derby High School offers a variety of sports programs, including winter sports like indoor track and basketball, as well as spring sports like baseball and fall sports like soccer and football.",
